# ThreeUI Community
## Install the React package
```
import { AtTheHorizon } from "@designcodeio/threeui";
import "@designcodeio/threeui/style.css";

export function Hero() {
  return <AtTheHorizon />;
}
```

## Synchronization
```
npm run sync:community -- /path/to/main-threeui
```
